+# TLS certificate verification in development builds
+
+The project's current recorded decision is "https everywhere, no exceptions": all connections use HTTPS, and that rule has no carve-out for development builds. The record states this rule only in those terms and does not record any separate setting, flag or mechanism for certificate verification in development builds, so none is defined here.
